SUMMARY:Sitting: the catalogue's pitches
DESCRIPTION:YOU\n\n1. Thirty minutes\, Sunday. Open the catalogue: https
 ://claude.ai/code/artifact/9ce6fac0-17fd-416b-a02a-bec67b8436c6\n2. Rea
 d down. For each row say the number and a letter: A the pitch stands\, 
 B rewrite (say the line or the gist)\, C cut the row. Rows you say noth
 ing about stand as A.\n3. Anything missing from the machine\, name it a
 nd it gets a row.\n4. Then the glass: open https://claude.ai/artifact/D
 fpetqdZQxXoNF16ccpj9g and say one letter\, A\, B or C (question 1 in QU
 ESTIONS-for-Sunday). Ten minutes.\n\nThe Days: https://claude.ai/code/a
 rtifact/207ed53f-1abf-4667-82e5-92e3259f4233
