SUMMARY:The sexy shoot: the Everyman
DESCRIPTION:YOU\n\n1. The rig of 09-18 (docs/SEXY-SHOOT-20260918.md): th
 e white sweep\, soft light from two sides\, the iPhone on the tripod\, 
 main lens\, 24 MP\, focus and exposure locked per item\, no rule\, noth
 ing else on the white\; white gloves whenever a hand is in frame. A sla
 te card with the item's name is the first frame of every item.\n2. The 
 first three frames (a hero\, a detail\, a document) are the proof. Then
 : the box\, every side with copy\, and open\; the unit: three-quarter\,
  front\, back\, top\, underside\, the plate\, the front glass\, the top
  window\; the case and cable\; the MGK-PHVDC and its three parts\; the 
 two ads\; the notebook\, cover and six spreads\; the original manuals\,
  cover and four pages\; the whole kit together. Video\, upright\, 4K 60
 \, HDR off: the unit turned slowly once (10 s)\; three close passes (5 
 s each)\; the unboxing in one take (30 to 60 s).\n3. Drop the originals
  in OneDrive › WeirdBaby › photos › everyman. Tell Code: "photos in". T
 he cover\, the plates\, the kit and the papers land on the album within
  two days.\n\nThe Days: https://claude.ai/code/artifact/207ed53f-1abf-4
 667-82e5-92e3259f4233
CATEGORIES:Weird.Baby You
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
