SUMMARY:Number sitting: what the porch tape lacks
DESCRIPTION:YOU\n\n1. One sitting: the DJI pair on the voice\, the iPhon
 e on the tripod\, the porch or the room. About 30 seconds each\, to cam
 era. The list is docs/NUMBER-PIECES-20260917.md\, section 4.\n2. 1. Who
  the song was written for: Coconuts\, 2025-03-13\, for Carina\; who she
  is to you and where the word came from.\n3. 2. The chair\, the egg\, t
 he bread: what the line means.\n4. 3. You are enough: the last verse\, 
 and who it is said to.\n5. 4 and 5\, if there is room: the hook shot cl
 ose (the phone at half the distance)\, twice\, so the weeks of 11-02 an
 d 11-09 open on a fresh frame.\n6. Drop them in OneDrive > WeirdBaby > 
 reels > intake > numbers as story-1.mp4\, story-2.mp4\, story-3.mp4 (ho
 ok-close-1.mp4\, hook-close-2.mp4).\n7. Tell Code: "numbers in". The li
 ne levels them\, appends the pop and queues the launch week.\n\nThe Day
 s: https://claude.ai/code/artifact/207ed53f-1abf-4667-82e5-92e3259f4233
